'''Iridonians''', also known as '''Iridonian Zabraks''', were a race of the [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Zabrak]] [[species]] [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Iridonia]].<ref name="Aftermath" />

[[Eeth Koth]]<ref name="Episode I">{{Film|I}}</ref> and [[Agen Kolar]] were Iridonian Zabraks who became [[Jedi]].<ref name="Revenge of the Sith" />

